# Performance Standards

- Avoid unnecessary heavy rendering.
- Keep rendering predictable and efficient.

## Components

- Lazy load large pages when appropriate.
- Avoid oversized component trees.
- Avoid unnecessary state updates.

## Assets

- Optimize images and assets.
- Avoid loading unnecessary resources.

## Rendering

- Use memoization only when justified.
- Avoid premature optimization.